  "abstract": "The paper\u2019s contribution beyond prior work is the proposal that alignment be treated as a mechanism design problem within Computative Economics rather than as a supervised learning problem within scarcity economics, together with the apparatus that proposal requires. None of the evidence items establishes that the computative reading is the correct one, and the paper does not claim it does.",
